      "divergence": "DELIBERATE DIVERGENCE from the pre-rebuild code, 2026-09-22, when the twelve regex and scanner reads of speaker XML became one bounded parser (OPEN-WORK 133). The old pattern required whitespace after <content, which is how it kept itself off elements whose name merely STARTS with content, so an attribute-less <content> was not recognised as a selection at all. A parser compares the tag, so that job is done exactly and this element is read: the selection reaches the master, which finds no location in it and ignores it with a line saying so. Nothing plays either way; what changes is where it is refused."
